cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "gengineer-pjdsc-2026: Public Health Analytics for PJDSC 2026"
abstract: >-
  An entry to the Philippine Junior Data Science Challenge (PJDSC) 2026,
  organized by the UP Data Science Society under the theme Public Health
  Analytics. The project integrates a CircuitPython microcontroller sensor
  node with a web application so that a community-level health signal can be
  measured, transmitted, and read by a non-technical health worker.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
